B.a_3=new A.al("feature_acid_splash","Acid Splash","[Action] Make a Ranged Attack vs Int targeting 1 enemy range 4/8. On success, the target gains {Source} d6 Burn vs Int. This burn damage ignores Resistance.\n\n[Reaction] When you succeed on an attack or an ally fails on an attack during their turn, spend your reaction and give the targets {Half Source}d6 Burn vs Int. This burn ignores resistance.",B.I,B.a8O,!1)
