B.Z7=new A.al("feature_annihilation","Annihilation","[Action] Make a Melee Attack vs Int against 1 enemy range 1, on success deal {Source d10} Damage ignoring shields and resistance and until the start of your next turn, if the target dies, They respawn at Half Health. If the target has an instead of death ability, reduce their new Health total by half.\n\n[Reaction] When a creature range 1 dies, [Reaction] and The target respawns at half health. If the target has an instead of death effect, reduce their new Health total by half.",B.I,B.aaG,!1)
