B.a_o=new A.al("feature_attach","Attach","[Action] Make a Melee Attack vs Str targeting an enemy range 1, On Success deal {Source d12} and Until the start of your next turn you are attached to the target, gaining +1 to Defense results. Whenever the target changes spaces, you follow them, dashing to a free space adjacent to them. You may only be attached to 1 creature at a time. You may target an ally, On Success, give them {Source d6} Shield instead and you attach to them, regardless of success.\n\n[Reaction] During you or your allies turns, attach to that ally until the start of your next turn. When you Succeed on a Melee Attack or Fail with an Attach attack, [Reaction] to attach to one of the targets.",B.I,B.abA,!1)
