B.a_r=new A.al("feature_bubble","Bubble","[Action] Target yourself or 1 ally range 4. Until the Start of your next turn, the target is surrounded by a bubble of water, and gains a +1 to defense results. You may end the effect early at any time other than during a character\u2019s ability. When the effect ends, make an Status Check vs Dex targeting each enemy range 1 of the target. On Success, deal {Source d6} Damage And push the enemy {Source} spaces away from the target.\n\n[Reaction] During your or ally turns, trigger your bubble action targeting the character whose turn it is.",B.I,B.abt,!1)
