B.a_w=new A.al("feature_burst","Burst","[Action] Make a Melee Attack vs Dex targeting all enemies in a {1 + half Source}x{1 + Half Source} space Square that contains at least 1 space adjacent to you. On a Success, Deal {Source d10} Damage.\n\n[Reaction] When you succeed on an attack or an ally fails on an attack, spend your reaction target all enemies in a {Source}x{Source} space Square that contains at least 1 space of target from the triggering attack. Deal {Half Source d10} to all enemies in the square.",B.I,B.aas,!1)
B.UX=new A.q("feature_clean_slippery","Slippery","When an enemy tries to stand after being knocked prone by Clean, make a status check vs dex. On Success, they lose all their speed and take {Source d6} damage.")
