B.Za=new A.al("feature_minkisi","Minkisi","[Action]: Target an ally in the initiative and make a status check. On success, make a minkisi that lasts as long as you remain concentrating. When you succeed, heal the target {Source d6} HP. The minkisi requires a hand to carry. Whenever you end your turn holding the minkisi, heal the target {Half Source d6}. \n\n[Reaction] During Ally turns, when they are range 1. Spend your reaction and take the minkisi action targeting the ally.\n\n[Reaction] While concentrating on a minkisi, during the target\u2019s turn, Spend your reaction and choose an ally within {Half Source} of the minkisi target and make a Status check. On Success heal the chosen ally {Source d6}.\n",B.at,B.a95,!1)
