B.Ux=new A.q("feature_shadow_dancer_Lead_your_Partner","Lead Your Partner","When you shadow dance, You may bring 1 adjacent ally with you and teleport them to an unoccupied square adjacent to your new location. They may not be teleported above another creature. The Ally gains Shadow\u2019s Edge & Shadow\u2019s Grace if Available.")
