B.YR=new A.al("feature_snuff_out","Snuff Out","[Action] make a melee attack vs Dex targeting 1 enemy range 5 with burn. On Success, deal {Source d8}, and have the target roll and take their burn damage then end their burn. \n\n[Reaction] When an enemy range 3 rolls burn dice, Spend your Reaction and the target rolls their burn again and also takes {Half Source d6}, Then end the burn.",B.I,B.aaz,!1)
B.Vh=new A.q("feature_slap_duel","Duel","On success, pick one of the targets, until the start of your next turn, the target has disadvantage on attacks that don't include you as a target and you have disadvantage on attacks that don\u2019t include the target as a target.")
