B.Zc=new A.al("feature_sleep","Sleep","[Action] Make a Ranged Attack vs Cha. On success target up to {Source} enemies range 6, and knock them prone and asleep. On the start of their turn, make a status check vs Wis. On success, they are stunned and remain asleep. Otherwise the effect ends for the target and they take their turn as normal. When sleeping, if an enemy is attacked or takes damage they wake up and the effect ends. An ally can spend an [Action] or [Reaction] to wake an ally.\n\n[Reaction] when an enemy is knocked prone, spend your reaction and make a status check vs Cha. On success, put the target and all prone enemies to sleep. If it is the target's turn, immediately make the status check as if it was the start of their turn.",B.I,B.aca,!1)
