B.Zx=new A.al("feature_tentacle","Tentacle","[Action] Make a Melee Attack vs Wis Targeting 1 enemy range 4. On Success, they take {Source d6} Damage and the target is grabbed by the tentacle until the start of your next turn. While grabbed they are restrained and you may place them in any free space range 3 of you. Whenever you move, you may move the target to a free space range 3 of you. \n\n[Reaction] When an enemy ends its turn range 3, Spend your reaction and make your tentacle attack against the triggering enemy.\n",B.I,B.abm,!1)
