B.a_m=new A.al("feature_throw","Throw","[Action: 1 Unarmed]: Make a Melee Attack vs Str targeting an enemy within 1, who is no more than 1 size bigger than you: On a Success, you may throw them to a free space within {2*Source} of you and deal {Source d10} Damage. When you throw an ally, they may make a Finesse to ignore the damage, otherwise they take half damage.\n\n[Reaction] When you succeed a defense against a melee attack, or an ally succeeds a defense against an enemy who is range 1 of you, spend your reaction, and if the target is no more than 1 size larger than you, dash them into a free space within {2*Source} and deal {Half Source d6} damage vs Str.",B.I,B.a9s,!1)
B.Wk=new A.q("feature_tornado_debris","Debris","Each time you move the tornado using your reaction, increase the damage it does by 1d12 up to max of {Power d12}.")
B.Yu=new A.q("feature_tornado_hurling","Hurling","Whenever you force a target to dash, dash them {Source} instead. When you target an ally and succeed, dash them {2 * Source} instead.")
B.T8=new A.q("feature_tornado_wind_step","Wind Step","When you succeed in targeting yourself or an ally, they gain {Half Source} bonus speed and a +1 to defenses from Ranged Attacks until the end of their next turn.")
B.a8u=s([B.Wk,B.Yu,B.T8],t.U)
B.Zl=new A.al("feature_tornado","Tornado","[Action] Target a 2 space radius within 6, and make a Ranged Attack vs Wis. On Success, deal {Source d6} damage to enemies there and dash all characters in the tornado to a free space within {Half Source}. Create a tornado there for as long as you remain concentrating. When a character starts its turn in the tornado, or enters it for the first time during their turn, make a Status Check vs Wis, On Success Deal {Half Source d6}, knock the target prone, and dash the target to a free space with {Half Source}. When you or allies enter, On success, they take no damage and aren\u2019t knocked prone, on Problems, they are affected as if you succeed against an enemy.\n\n[Reaction] During your turn while concentrating, Spend your reaction to move your tornado {Source} spaces. For each creature that the tornado passes over, make the status check against them, targeting no creature more than once.  ",B.I,B.a8u,!1)
B.WP=new A.q("feature_tribal_elder_Sage","Sage","After using Treatment Advice or as a [Reaction] during your turn, you may begin concentrating on sage. While concentrating sage reduce your speed by {Half Source}, and allies within {Source} of you get a +1 bonus to defense results.")
B.V0=new A.q("feature_tribal_elder_Surgeon","Surgeon","When you succeed on coordinated Aid, you end any burn or bleed the target has, if they had none heal {Source d12} instead. After using Treatment Advice, if the target had burn or bleed, make a status check and on success end the burn or bleed. If both or multiple different burns you may only end 1 effect.")
B.U1=new A.q("feature_tribal_elder_Teacher","Teacher","Allies within {Half Source} of you gain +1 to Coordinated Aid Status Checks. After you use Coordinate Aid, Until the start of your next turn, allies range {Source} of you may spend their [Reaction] during their turn or any allies turn to Target 1 ally range 1 and make a status check. On Success, they heal the target {Targets vitality d6} or give the target the same amount of shield. They may target themselves, but must make the check with disadvantage.")
B.acz=s([B.WP,B.V0,B.U1],t.U)
B.Zp=new A.al("feature_tribal_elder","Tribal Elder","Coordinated Aid [Action]: Target {Half Source} allies range 6 and each target may choose 1 ally range 1 and make a status check. On success, either Heal the ally {Source d6} or grant them {Source d6} shield, healers choice. You may target yourself. A target may heal themselves but must make the status check with disadvantage.\n\nTreatment Advice: [Reaction] When an ally range {Source} fails a defense against a status check, spend your reaction, and the target rerolls the check with a +1 to results.\n",B.at,B.acz,!1)
B.Ww=new A.q("feature_tribal_gatherer_Hold_this","Hold this","After using any [Reaction] that triggers because an ally, the ally may give you any item they are carrying.")
B.VK=new A.q("feature_tribal_gatherer_Nomadic","Nomadic","After using Coordinated Movement, Retreat, or Work, At the end of the round, you and allies range {Source} may move up to {Source}.")
B.VH=new A.q("feature_tribal_gatherer_Communication","Communication","When you use Coordinated Work, each ally in range also gains 1 reroll for that same skill. ")
B.a9R=s([B.Ww,B.VK,B.VH],t.U)
B.ZT=new A.al("feature_tribal_gatherer","Tribal Gatherer","Coordinated Movement [Reaction]: When you or an ally you can see Uses [Run], you may spend your reaction, you and allies range {Source} may immediately move up to their speed.\n\nCoordinated Retreat: [Reaction] When you or an ally you can see Uses [Retreat], you may spend your reaction, you and allies range {Source} may immediately move up to half their speed without provoking.\n\nCoordinated Work [Reaction]: When an ally range {Source} uses an action to make a skill check, you may spend your reaction, to give them 1 reroll and 1 additional reroll per ally within {Half Source} of the target. These rerolls can only be used on that specific skill and last until the end of the situation.\n",B.at,B.a9R,!1)
B.Uv=new A.q("feature_tribal_hunter_Packhunter","Packhunter","Until the start of your next turn, allies who attack targeted enemies increase their damage by {Half Source d6}.")
B.WI=new A.q("feature_tribal_hunter_Leader_of_the_Hunt","Leader of the Hunt","After Coordinated Strike or Joint Strike, Until the start of your next turn, allies within {source} spaces of you have +1 to attack results.")
B.UA=new A.q("feature_tribal_hunter_Gather_and_Prepare","Gather and Prepare","[Action] You and all Allies range {source} may move up to {source} spaces, then may make a conceal check to hide. Until the end of your next turn, you and your allies have a +1 to Coordinated Strike attack results.")
B.ach=s([B.Uv,B.WI,B.UA],t.U)
B.a_j=new A.al("feature_tribal_hunter","Tribal Hunter","Coordinated Strike [Action]: You and {Source/3} allies range 6 make either a Ranged Attack vs Dex Range 6 or Melee Attack vs Str range 1 targeting one enemy, on success deal {Source d6} damage for Ranged, and {Source d8} for melee. Each attacker chooses range or melee individually.\n\nJoint Strike [Reaction] Before an Ally you can see makes an attack during their turn, Spend your reaction and give the ally a +1 to the attack result. If they succeed, If the attack was Melee, target an enemy range 1, and deal {Source d8} damage vs Str, if the attack was Ranged, target an enemy range 6 and deal {Source d6} damage vs Dex.",B.I,B.ach,!1)
