B.J8=new A.h_("Wind","Combat: After attacking, Dash you and the targets of the attack up to {Half Level} in the same direction. Adventuring: Cause a gust of wind strong enough to knock a person over for a few seconds.","After attacking, Dash you and the targets of the attack up to {Half Level} in the same direction.","Cause a gust of wind strong enough to knock a person over for a few seconds.")
