B.J4=new A.h_("Death","Combat: Deal the damage of the attack to an untargeted enemy range 6 of one of the targets. Adventuring: Ask 3 questions of a recently dead body, the body answers truthfully but only what it experienced since it was spawned.","Deal the damage of the attack to an untargeted enemy range 6 of one of the targets.","Ask 3 questions of a recently dead body, the body answers truthfully but only what it experienced since it was spawned.")
B.J9=new A.h_("Life","Combat: Target an ally range 3 and heal them {Half Level d6}. Adventuring: Treat 1 exhaustion.","Target an ally range 3 and heal them {Half Level d6}.","Treat 1 exhaustion.")
B.J1=new A.h_("Lightning","Combat: Target all enemies within 3 of any of the targets excluding the targets. Deal {Half Level d6} damage to all prone enemies and otherwise knock them prone. Adventuring: Zap a person or device with electricity momentarily stunning it.","Target all enemies within 3 of any of the targets excluding the targets. Deal {Half Level d6} damage to all prone enemies and otherwise knock them prone.","Zap a person or device with electricity momentarily stunning it.")
