B.ayo=new A.bN("weapon_ranged_Bow_Burst","Bow, Burst Shooting",B.b8,"Target {Source/3} targets and make an attack and damage roll against each. You may target the same creature multiple times. You cannot take multiple shots if restrained, or if an enemy is adjacent to you.","6 / 12","{Source d6}","{Source d8}","Dex")
B.ayD=new A.bN("weapon_ranged_Bow_Horseback","Bow, Horseback",B.b8,'"Before attacking, dash you and your mount 1 space. On Problems, Any creature that could have made an attack of opportunity if you moved instead of dash may do so.\nOn Success, You may move your mount {Source} spaces.\nYou ignore ranged attack penalty from moving too far on a mount."',"6 / 12","{Source d8}","{Source d10}","Dex")
B.ayh=new A.bN("weapon_ranged_crossbow","Crossbow",B.b8,"You have advantage on attacks within the short range when targeting non adjacent enemies. Deal {Half Source d6} extra damage when firing over a barrier. You must Ready your crossbow to use it again by spending an action or reaction during your turn. Your crossbow starts ready unless jumped or surprised.","5 / 10","{Source d8}","{Source d10}","Dex")
